Third-party patches
===================

patches/src/main/kotlin/app/template/patches/ninegag/ is derived from the Adobo
patch project, https://github.com/jkennethcarino/adobo, and is redistributed
under the same GNU General Public License v3 as the rest of this repository.
The upstream project and its authors retain copyright and attribution.

Baseline commit recorded by the source this was ported from:
a42ace2651824c26f95fdaed98fa5a7e7dd5eae2 (upstream release 1.5.0).

Changes made in this repository:

- Repackaged under app.template.patches.ninegag, from upstream's
  dev.custom.ninegag823 naming, so the classes cannot collide with the upstream
  patch set if both are ever present in the same session.
- The four app.morphe.util helpers it borrowed (returnEarly,
  returnBoxedBooleanEarly, findMutableMethodOf, getReference) were replaced with
  local equivalents under patches/ninegag/util, so no code from the separate
  morphe-patches-library artifact is vendored here. The byte-for-byte behaviour of
  the original Adobo 9GAG patches is otherwise preserved.
- Targets 9GAG 8.23.0 (com.ninegag.android.app, version code 80230000), with the
  banner, promoted-post and layout changes from that version, which supersede the
  earlier 8.17.5 baseline in upstream.

The 9GAG application itself remains third-party software. It is not distributed
with this repository and no ownership of it is claimed.

